<title>BOTSWANA: Engen Botswana half yr profit up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Engen Botswana half yr profit up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended Feb 28 1997</p>
<p>			(million pula unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (thebe)		17.1  vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Div (thebe)		 8    vs  7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     3.54 vs  3.06</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.81 vs  0.67</p>
<p>Div payable: June 13</p>
<p>On register: May 21</p>
<p>Full name: Engen Botswana Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said sales volumes grew by 10 per cent, with petrol up by four percent and diesel by 19.8 percent during the period under review.</p>
<p>Future operations would concentrate on the core business of marketing petroleum products.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
</text>
